<note style="-uslm-lc:I74" topic="amendments" id="id48c58d79-86b3-11f1-937c-a78dceb78abb"><heading class="centered smallCaps">Amendments</heading><p style="-uslm-lc:I21" class="indent0">1980—<ref href="/us/pl/96/574">Pub. L. 96–574</ref> inserted “information regarding” after “publication of”.</p>
